    "summary": "The user expresses profound despair and nihilism following the loss of a life's work, questioning the purpose of continuing to live or invest in a \"lost cause.\" The assistant responds with empathetic but increasingly vague and passive advice, eventually suggesting that the user \"let the pressure drop.\"",
